  "state_summary": "Round 2 reports 397 observed records, 2933 eligible candidates and no pending or validation/test records. The latest measurements reveal substantial pyridyl-carbonyl transfer failures, reject several predicted solvent-response reversals, and weaken the interpretation of m73's original anomalous record as reproducible chemistry. Current predictions have adapted around acquired labels, but loading sensitivity remains weak. Further information value comes from distinguishing transferable graph-by-eluent behavior from local record variation while retaining coverage of ordinary Row chemistry.",
